sequenceDiagram
participant U as User
participant F as Frontend
participant A as API
participant R as Workflow Registry
participant X as Executor
participant P as Amplitude
U->>F: Open character surface
F->>F: Render inert PNG
U->>F: Click hotspot
F->>U: Request explicit consent
U-->>F: Consent granted
F->>A: Authorize action
A->>R: Confirm action is allowlisted
R-->>A: Allowed module
A-->>F: Authorization context
F->>A: Execute workflow
A->>X: Run local handler with timeout
X-->>A: Structured result
A->>P: Log completion/failure
A-->>F: Return result
